{"4683420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Toypunk", "steam_appid": 4683420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toypunk is a roguelite third-person puppet-shooter. Customize your own puppet avatar, grab a friend, and fight against hordes of fuzzy monsters terrorizing the <strong><i>Imaginality:</i></strong> a fantastical alternate dimension of whimsy and peril.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683420/extras/8f9b067c3f81ff359c37b6b225ca1daa.avif?t=1788231556\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683420/extras_big/8f9b067c3f81ff359c37b6b225ca1daa.webp?t=1788231556 width=1560 height=322 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and unload an arsenal of toy-themed weapons that launch marbles, shoot dice, fling frisbees, and more. Or, just slap away with a weaponized Rubber Chicken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683420/extras/caec8fb1574178195542c95602044511.poster.avif?t=1788231556\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683420/extras/caec8fb1574178195542c95602044511.webm?t=1788231556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683420/extras/caec8fb1574178195542c95602044511.mp4?t=1788231556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683420/extras/e255f846f91dbfbbc2c5e77a6338c80a.avif?t=1788231556\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683420/extras_big/e255f846f91dbfbbc2c5e77a6338c80a.webp?t=1788231556 width=1560 height=300 /></span>Put the doll in “ragdoll”. Send your enemies flying, knock ‘em down, and shred ‘em to threads as comedic third-person combat unfurls. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683420/extras/649767e8fe8a2887ec0de6d2feb0279a.poster.avif?t=1788231556\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683420/extras/649767e8fe8a2887ec0de6d2feb0279a.webm?t=1788231556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683420/extras/649767e8fe8a2887ec0de6d2feb0279a.mp4?t=1788231556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683420/extras/83f20aae02303fbebdfae2024022656e.avif?t=1788231556\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683420/extras_big/83f20aae02303fbebdfae2024022656e.webp?t=1788231556 width=1560 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated levels and randomized loot make every run unique. Hop in for a quick run or make it a marathon. Feel rewarded either way! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683420/extras/4c231922ea6f4cbd2ec3c305fe0a6b5e.poster.avif?t=1788231556\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683420/extras/4c231922ea6f4cbd2ec3c305fe0a6b5e.webm?t=1788231556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683420/extras/4c231922ea6f4cbd2ec3c305fe0a6b5e.mp4?t=1788231556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683420/extras/aea0a913e36826071fef08d1c5214ce1.avif?t=1788231556\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683420/extras_big/aea0a913e36826071fef08d1c5214ce1.webp?t=1788231556 width=1560 height=359 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or with friends. Capitalize on over-the-top co-op synergies, but beware! More toys = more zaniness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683420/extras/2d24d5d84dd8ecfceedb58d2499b9304.poster.avif?t=1788231556\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683420/extras/2d24d5d84dd8ecfceedb58d2499b9304.webm?t=1788231556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683420/extras/2d24d5d84dd8ecfceedb58d2499b9304.mp4?t=1788231556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683420/extras/21fc09b5db7a456fbaa282a50f77a442.avif?t=1788231556\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683420/extras_big/21fc09b5db7a456fbaa282a50f77a442.webp?t=1788231556 width=1560 height=324 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through the <i><strong>Imaginality</strong></i>: an alternate dimension where all Ideas come from. Warp between fantastical biomes and stop baddies from unraveling the Fabric of the multiverse. Build up your arsenal to face down the biggest, baddest Ideas out there.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683420/extras/3553d1975095a77260d8dd893ff7aafa.poster.avif?t=1788231556\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683420/extras/3553d1975095a77260d8dd893ff7aafa.webm?t=1788231556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683420/extras/3553d1975095a77260d8dd893ff7aafa.mp4?t=1788231556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683420/extras/2481924cf61138c3c37160ee5c105b17.avif?t=1788231556\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683420/extras_big/2481924cf61138c3c37160ee5c105b17.webp?t=1788231556 width=1560 height=276 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fabricate a Foppit: fuzzy, plushy puppets that are a 50/50 blend of deadly and adorable. Customize them with oodles of unlockable cosmetics, so you’ll always be fighting in style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683420/extras/83ad0624969f06f95f14aecb2ae806bd.poster.avif?t=1788231556\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683420/extras/83ad0624969f06f95f